    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but my doctor is always so busy and it's a huge pain to get an appointment just for this. i looked online and people with kidney issues say they get cramps when their electrolytes are off. can u just tell me if like, a small dose of potassium would be okay to try for a few days just to see if the cramps go away? like maybe just one pill a day?",
