      "content": "idk i just feel like i can't wait... the cramps are getting really bad and its making it hard to sleep. if i dont do the potassium then what am i supposed to do? are there like any other supplements or even just some high potassium foods like bananas or spinach i can eat instead of pills? i just need something to help right now.",
